topics work +0.5 home +0.4 weather +0.3 food +0.2
styles comfort=direct gossip=reluctant refuse=firm tease=dry
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# lifts #sheets# from the #vat# in time with an old #march#, keeps the #floor# dry, and watches the #stars# over a tidy #house#.

words
oath! = Vat and straight edge | By the clean deckle
saying! = Lift the sheet before it settles | A dry floor saves a day's work
paper = paper | handmade paper
sheet = sheet | wet sheet
